  "$comment": "Specification fixture, not an installed node. Strings count Unicode code points; runtime rejects unpaired surrogates, duplicate JSON keys, bool-as-int, float/exponent integer tokens, and state larger than 65536 UTF-8 bytes. Preview does not sample or load weights. base_seed and image are separate node inputs, not duplicated in this state."
